# Internal engineering docs (kept local, not for the public repo)
# 2026-08-21: untracked via `git rm -r --cached docs/` — see analysis before force-purge
# Keep the whole /docs/ tree ignored, then re-include only the three release
# acceptance matrices that scripts/acceptance_preflight.sh (CI) requires.
# (A plain `!/docs/X.md` cannot override `/docs/` because git won't descend
# into an ignored dir, so we un-ignore the dir, ignore its contents, and
# re-include the three contract files.)
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/V17_MANUAL_ACCEPTANCE.md
!/docs/V18_MANUAL_ACCEPTANCE.md
!/docs/V19_RELEASE_ACCEPTANCE.md
/build/

releases/
.workbuddy/
